{"id":"vod_bf_6620","vodId":"6620","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"大神与七位伙伴","name_cn":"大神与七位伙伴","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-7/b9b31b0522708a5847831e0c7d2b8057.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在御伽学园里，大神凉子（伊藤静 配音）是一个身材娇小但个性十分凶悍的傲娇少女。在学园中，有一个名为御伽学园学生互助协会的神秘组织，而大神正是其中的一员。此外，还有患有视线恐惧症的跟踪狂森野亮士（入野自由 配音），外表可爱内心腹黑至极的赤井林檎（伊藤加奈惠 配音），异装癖患者桐木李斯特（野岛裕史 配音），成熟稳重的大姐姐桐木爱丽斯（堀江由衣 配音）等6人均是此神秘组织中的成员。　　扶助协会的任务是在紧要关头令需要帮助的人欠下人情，再在需要之时逼迫他们偿还债务，这看似无理的粗暴做法其实饱含了成员们的良苦用心。而为了让世界变得更好，大神和她的七个伙伴们每天都在不懈的努力着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:48:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dashenyuqiweihuoban/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:32.414Z"}